      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The use-after-free needs a caller that passes an existing stack to PEM_X509_INFO_read_bio(_ex). Every caller in these images passes NULL: libcurl (lib/vtls/openssl.c), the openssl CLI (apps/rehash.c, apps/crl2pkcs7.c) and libcrypto's own X509_load_cert_crl_file (crypto/x509/by_file.c); Python's _ssl and _hashlib do not import it."
